# Web3Forms access key for the contact form (https://web3forms.com).
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill it in. In GitHub Actions it is set as a repository secret.
# Note: it is sent from the browser, so it ends up in the public JS by design. Web3Forms keys only
# allow submitting to your inbox; restrict the allowed domain in the Web3Forms dashboard.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
